type: software
title: "backtest-framework"
abstract: >-
  An event-driven backtesting framework for equities and futures, with composable cost
  models, a structural look-ahead guard, an append-only trial registry with the deflated
  Sharpe ratio, and tests anchored to hand-computed ledgers and an independent engine.
